    {
      "name": "adversarial/declared-path-needs-a-component-boundary",
      "why": "A declaration of `per.pdf` must not be satisfied by `paper.pdf`. Without the boundary rule, a bare ends_with would attach the wrong file with confidence 1.0 — the worst failure this module can have.",
